                [
                    771.0,
                    167.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    167.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• They are relatively short, fewer than ten or so words.",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                180,
                587,
                205
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    116.0,
                    180.0
                ],
                [
                    587.0,
                    180.0
                ],
                [
                    587.0,
                    205.0
                ],
                [
                    116.0,
                    205.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- They are intended to reflect a mind at work, as if the writer were speaking to you, finishing a sentence, then immediately expanding and qualifying it. Almost as an afterthought, often ironically.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                213,
                771,
                290
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    213.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    213.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    290.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    290.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In this passage, Mark Twain uses sentence fragments along with sentences beginning with conjunctions to capture the element of chance in the circumstances that made him an author (fragments are boldfaced):",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                303,
                772,
                380
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    303.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    380.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    380.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For amusement I scribbled things for the Virginia City Enterprise.... One of my efforts attracted attention, and the Enterprise sent for me and put me on its staff.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                392,
                742,
                442
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    114.0,
                    392.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    392.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    442.0
                ],
                [
                    114.0,
                    442.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "And so I became a journalist—another link. By and by Circumstance and the Sacramento Union sent me to the Sandwich Islands for five or six months, to write up sugar. I did it; and threw in a good deal of extraneous matter that hadn't anything to do with sugar. But it was this extraneous matter that helped me to another link.",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                455,
                742,
                580
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    455.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    455.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    580.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    580.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It made me notorious, and San Francisco invited me to lecture. Which I did. And profitably. I had long had a desire to travel and see the world, and now Circumstance had most kindly and unexpectedly hurled me upon the platform and furnished me the means. So I joined the \"Quaker City Excursion.\"",
            "block_bbox": [
                113,
                595,
                742,
                696
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    113.0,
                    595.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    595.0
                ],
                [
                    742.0,
                    696.0
                ],
                [
                    113.0,
                    696.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "——“The Turning-Point of My Life”",
            "block_bbox": [
                480,
                710,
                744,
                735
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    480.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    744.0,
                    710.0
                ],
                [
                    744.0,
                    735.0
                ],
                [
                    480.0,
                    735.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You should know, however, that writers rarely use sentence fragments in academic prose. They are generally considered too casual. If you decide to experiment, be sure that your audience can tell that you know what you're doing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                748,
                772,
                827
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.99995422363281,
                    747.9999389648438
                ],
                [
                    770.3184204101562,
                    741.9622192382812
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    819.9999389648438
                ],
                [
                    79.6815185546875,
                    826.0376586914062
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Punctuating Beginnings",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                845,
                384,
                878
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 11,
            "global_block_id": 11,
            "global_group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    384.0,
                    845.0
                ],
                [
                    384.0,
                    878.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    878.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "You won't have to punctuate the beginning of a sentence if it begins directly with its subject (as this one does). However, as with this one, when a sentence forces a reader to plow through several introductory words, phrases, and clauses, especially when they have their own internal, perhaps even complicated, punctuation and readers might be confused by it all (as you may be right now), forget trying to get the punctuation right: just revise it.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                889,
                772,
                1044
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 12,
            "global_block_id": 12,
            "global_group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    889.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    889.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1044.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    1044.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "There are a few rules that your readers expect you to follow, but more often you have to rely on judgment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                1045,
                772,
                1097
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 13,
            "global_block_id": 13,
            "global_group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
